asset:        displacement.wgsl
title:        GL Transitions "displacement" transition shader, hand-ported to WGSL
author:       Travis Fischer (upstream GLSL); FilmCraft contributors (WGSL port and Rust reference)
source:       https://github.com/gl-transitions/gl-transitions/blob/master/transitions/displacement.glsl
license:      MIT
license-file: crates/render/src/transitions/shader/LICENSE-gl-transitions.txt
added:        2026-10-17 by FilmCraft contributors (C2, lane T)
notes:        Hand port of the upstream GLSL to WGSL, keeping its Author/License header; the upstream header says License: MIT. The FilmCraft host (prelude.wgsl, original work) supplies the bindings, progress (eased on the CPU), getFromColor/getToColor and getMap. The Rust reference of the same function is in cpu.rs. Changes from upstream: the displacementMap texture is the host's generated grayscale map (transitions/shader/maps.rs: clouds, cells, spiral, conical, radial, square, linear or blinds, computed from scratch; no image is shipped or read).
